    22.6087,0.6029,1.067188,      !- X,Y,Z ==> Vertex 2 {m}  Derived from: X = W = 22.6087 m; Y = edge margin m1 = 0.6029 m (prototype value, not in the documents); Z = top - window height h = 1.9817 - 0.91451 = 1.067188 m (h as the prototype writes it; back-calculated value: see the comment on the windows).
    22.6087,15.8398,1.067188,     !- X,Y,Z ==> Vertex 3 {m}  Derived from: X = W = 22.6087 m; Y = D_dining - m1 = 16.4426 - 0.6029 = 15.8397 m (the prototype value is 15.8398, the formula gives 15.8397); Z = top - window height h = 1.9817 - 0.91451 = 1.067188 m (h as the prototype writes it; back-calculated value: see the comment on the windows).
