    GenericLayer,                 !- Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus needs a construction for the interior wall and the attic roof planes; the resistance 0.2 m2-K/W is assumed.
    MediumRough,                  !- Roughness
    0.2;                          !- Thermal Resistance {m2-K/W}, round value; no thermal mass

  Construction,
    GenericSurface,               !- Name
    GenericLayer;                 !- Outside Layer

